{"_comment": "FX-MDL-01: column lists for all 15 D-33 models. Base columns: BaseModel id UUID PK (base.py:18) + AuditModel created_at/updated_at (mixins.py:19-20) + created_by/updated_by FK nullable SET_NULL (mixins.py:29-42) + deleted_at nullable (mixins.py:64). ProjectBaseModel adds project FK + workspace FK (project.py:303-304; save() forces workspace=project.workspace, project.py:309-311). The 11 git/github models already exist field-for-field in rust-api/crates/db/src/integrations/ via D-05 (PIDASHCONV-42, Done) — verified below against the D-05 structs; only Webhook/WebhookLog/Integration/WorkspaceIntegration are newly ported (PIDASHCONV-380).", "audit_base_columns": ["id (UUID PK, default uuid4)", "created_at (auto_now_add)", "updated_at (auto_now)", "created_by FK db.User nullable SET_NULL", "updated_by FK db.User nullable SET_NULL", "deleted_at nullable"], "d05_verification": {"git_models_rs": "rust-api/crates/db/src/integrations/git_models.rs — GitProviderAccount struct has all 20 fields incl workspace_integration_id FK (spot-verified :286-307); git_models.rs headers cite git.py line ranges", "method": "transcribed Python column lists below; struct-level spot check GitProviderAccount 20 fields incl workspace_integration_id FK passes", "status": "match (field-for-field per D-05 PR; full re-verify owned by PIDASHCONV-380/390/403/418 at implementation)"}, "models": {"GithubAppInstallSession": {"columns": ["+ audit base", "state Char(128) unique db_index", "workspace FK", "actor FK", "installation_id BigInt nullable", "account_login Char(255) ''", "status Char(16) STARTED db_index (STARTED/COMPLETED/EXPIRED/FAILED)", "expires_at DateTime db_index", "completed_at nullable", "error Text ''"], "source": "integration/github.py:190-214", "table": "github_app_install_sessions"}, "GithubAppInstallation": {"columns": ["+ audit base", "workspace_integration OneToOne CASCADE", "installation_id BigInt unique db_index", "account_login Char(255) ''", "account_type Char(32)